    public double? WeightKg { get; set; }
}
```

Edit `ShipmentTracker/Data/ApplicationDbContext.cs` to add:
```csharp
public DbSet<Shipment> Shipments => Set<Shipment>();
```
And in `OnModelCreating`, add a unique index on TrackingNumber.

### 5. Server-side Service Implementation

Create `ShipmentTracker/Services/ServerShipmentService.cs` that implements `IShipmentService` using `ApplicationDbContext` directly.

### 6. API Endpoints

Add minimal API endpoints in server `Program.cs`:
- `GET /api/shipments` - all shipments (Dispatcher only)
- `GET /api/shipments/track/{trackingNumber}` - track by number (authenticated)
- `GET /api/shipments/customer/{email}` - customer's shipments (authenticated)
- `POST /api/shipments` - create shipment (Dispatcher only)
